  title: A hand at the window
  body: 'PRIVATE MEMORY / Unverified personal fragment

    Rain on warm glass. Someone
    holds your hand and says: if they ask what you remember, tell them the light.
    You remember the hand instead.

    COMMANDER: The record carries no name. Keep
    it anyway.'
